  "selection_reason": [
    "No-PNS control at the exact original full-length AAC frame phase removes the huge N029 burst (residual25347 to290 in codec-v002-master control); no-MS/no-IS alone do not. PNS is the principal cause in this encoder/content combination.",
    "PNSoff alone on the original master still has N033 residual4971 at203.699479s and9 flagged10ms windows. Adding ISoff reduces N033 maximum residual to1032, flags0, and whole-film residual maximum4971to1136. This measured difference justifies the additional ISoff setting.",
    "Keeping MS auto has lower reconstruction error than forced MS or separate stereo coding. Forcing identical channel samples is not the acceptance criterion.",
    "The original unchanged master restores N029 normal gain, removing the unnecessary old complete-cue\u22123.5dB workaround; no source speech, timing, retake or mastering change is introduced.",
    "Only selected-candidate X0302 conservative10ms warnings remain, explicitly reviewed using absolute residualRMS, raw waveform and new local lexical/phone evidence. No threshold is relaxed to hide the old N029 negative control."
  ],
